  "releaseNotes": "v3.240.89:\n\t\t- Fixed: LogicMonitor also returns an API token type of \"agentic\", which ApiTokenType did\n\t\t  not define, so reading users failed on the token rather than on the role privilege that\n\t\t  3.240.88 addressed. The two are separate enums and both had to be declared; this one was\n\t\t  reached only once the first was fixed. ApiTokenType now defines Agentic.\n\t\t- Fixed: ViewPermission did not model the MetricsExplorer field LogicMonitor now returns on\n\t\t  every user. As with Role.tenantIdentifier in 3.240.88, this failed only in Debug builds,\n\t\t  which set MissingMemberHandling.Error; release builds ignore unmodelled members.",
